      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MAKE WAVES (1) turned in a plain effort last time when sixth at this track over 340m behind Inner West (19.99) in a Grade 4. Was in the money prior to that. Strong form has emerged from her last run. Better than last start and worth following up. SUNDARA (2) stalked lead from an outside box last start before finishing third (30.62) at Launceston in a Grade 5 over 515m. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and four minor placings to her credit. Will give a great sight again. YOU WHO (6) has some solid form under her belt and proved too classy last time to win by 2 lengths at this track in a handy 19.39 beating Mini Mara. Can go close again if runs up to latest figure. ANGRY MAC (4) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
